---
/**
 * Local SVG sprite — inlined once per page in BaseLayout, referenced with
 * <Icon name="…" />. Never an icon font and never a CDN: same privacy reason
 * as the self-hosted typefaces, plus zero extra requests.
 *
 * Five category marks (key/case/doc/shield/stamp) and three UI marks
 * (check/print/search) come from docs/design/design-optionen.src.html; the
 * rest are per-letter marks drawn to the same grid — 24×24, stroke 1.5, round
 * caps, shapes kept inside 2.8–21.2 so they optically align at 24px.
 */
